WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.676
Reshaping often happens after joins The danger is
that a join can

00:00:05.702 --> 00:00:11.562
multiply fact rows If you join a patient dimension
to admissions the

00:00:11.588 --> 00:00:17.561
admission grain can remain intact But joining
admissions to another one-to-many

00:00:17.574 --> 00:00:23.131
child table can create repeated admission
combinations Always check

00:00:23.158 --> 00:00:25.487
cardinality before pivoting joined data
